Build and validation commands
-----------------------------

Rebuild and restart the UI container:

    docker compose up -d --build wis2downloader-ui

Validation commands run during implementation:

    python3 -m compileall -q modules/ui tests/test_download_files.py
    docker compose config -q

Both completed successfully. A Python smoke test also confirmed that valid
paths resolve and traversal paths and symlinks to files outside the downloads
directory are rejected. The pytest suite was not run because pytest is not
installed in the environment.
